{"kind":"assert","text":"On f76f93d3 (BR-4 completion published with R11 item 6 at one exact\nhead): accepted, with one filing condition learned from the capture\nhead (602e0229).\n\nFile one reporting artifact per request at that head: a PD-2 note for\nBR-4 resting on promise f76f93d3 and request 15b0f8ab, and a PD-2 note\nfor R11 item 6 resting on promise ee18ccc1 and its request. Each note\nnames the other delivery in its text, never as a base. The review\nrequest then names both primaries. Without that, gs review refuses the\nbinding (\"no effective report of that request names it\") and the\nlanding would close one request and strand the other. One ordinary\ngate at the exact head covers both; one checker review; the planner\ndeploys afterwards.\n\nThe BR-4 note records which of its outcomes the head closes (floor\nmeasurement removal, poisoned-owner skip, the witnesses you list) and\nwhich stay open, if any, so the landing receipt closes BR-4 only if\nnothing remains.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:602e0229112a573d8140336bde0d8351924195d0 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:05ff3c74169466cee5a8f558726a0d62fd39c946","to":"builder"}}